ents | from here, | with | ID card. | If not, | it's | {$fare}.␟Only for local students, with their ID. Otherwise it's {$fare}.":{"gloss":"Tik | — | studentams | vietiniams, | su | pažymėjimu. | Kitaip | tai | {$fare}.","nat":"Tik vietiniams studentams su pažymėjimu. Kitiems – {$fare}."},"Solo | para | estudiantes | de aquí, | con | carné. | Si no, | son | {$fare}.␟Only | for | students | from here, | with | ID card. | If not, | it's | {$fare}.␟Only for local students, with their ID. Otherwise it's {$fare}.":{"gloss":"Tik | — | studentams | vietiniams, | su | pažymėjimu. | Kitaip | tai | {$fare}.","nat":"Tik vietiniams studentams su pažymėjimu. Kitiems – {$fare}."},"Con | el | celular | no, | perdón. | Solo | efectivo.␟With | the | phone | no, | sorry. | Only | cash.␟Not by phone, sorry. Cash only.":{"gloss":"Su | — | telefonu | ne, | atsiprašau. | Tik | grynaisiais.","nat":"Telefonu negalima, atsiprašau. Tik grynaisiais."},"Con | el | móvil | no, | perdón. | Solo | efectivo.␟With | the | phone | no, | sorry. | Only | cash.␟Not by phone, sorry. Cash only.":{"gloss":"Su | — | telefonu | ne, | atsiprašau. | Tik | grynaisiais.","nat":"Telefonu negalima, atsiprašau. Tik grynaisiais."},"Hay | un | cajero | en | la | terminal, | ahí | adentro.␟There's | an | ATM | in | the | terminal, | there | inside.␟There's an ATM inside the terminal.":{"gloss":"Yra | — | bankomatas | — | — | stotyje, | ten | viduje.","nat":"Stoties viduje yra bankomatas."},"Hay | un | cajero | en | la | terminal, | ahí | dentro.␟There's | an | ATM | in | the | terminal, | there | inside.␟There's an ATM inside the terminal.":{"gloss":"Yra | — | bankomatas | — | — | stotyje, | ten | viduje.","nat":"Stoties viduje yra bankomatas."},"Sí, | claro, | en efectivo.␟Yes, | sure, | in cash.␟Yes, sure, cash is fine.":{"gloss":"Taip, | žinoma, | grynaisiais.","nat":"Taip, žinoma, grynaisiais galima."},"No se preocupe, | aquí | es | solo | efectivo.␟Don't worry, | here | it's | only | cash.␟Don't worry, it's cash 